  "caveats": [
    "Unfinished prototype, last pushed in 2013; triple bonds and automatic heteroatom hydrogens are unimplemented.",
    "README export claims exceed the bundled UI: MOL/SVG output is console-based; SMILES requires an unbundled backend.",
